Use FlexCom20.pkg

Define OLEMarkupCursor for Integer
    Define OLExtpMarkupCursorNone for 0
    Define OLExtpMarkupCursorNo for 32648
    Define OLExtpMarkupCursorArrow for 32512
    Define OLExtpMarkupCursorAppStarting for 32650
    Define OLExtpMarkupCursorCross for 32515
    Define OLExtpMarkupCursorIBeam for 32513
    Define OLExtpMarkupCursorSizeAll for 32646
    Define OLExtpMarkupCursorSizeNESW for 32643
    Define OLExtpMarkupCursorSizeNS for 32645
    Define OLExtpMarkupCursorSizeNWSE for 32642
    Define OLExtpMarkupCursorSizeWE for 32644
    Define OLExtpMarkupCursorUpArrow for 32516
    Define OLExtpMarkupCursorWait for 32514
    Define OLExtpMarkupCursorHand for 32649

Define OLEXTPMarkupSmoothingMode for Integer
    Define OLExtpMarkupSmoothingDefault for 0
    Define OLExtpMarkupSmoothingNone for 1
    Define OLExtpMarkupSmoothingHighSpeed for 2
    Define OLExtpMarkupSmoothingHighQuality for 3
    Define OLExtpMarkupSmoothingAntiAlias for 4

Class cSigCjComMarkupObject is a cComAutomationObject
End_Class

Class cSigCjComMarkupRoutedEvent is a cComAutomationObject

    { MethodType=Property DesignTime=False }
    Function ComName Returns String
        Handle hDispatchDriver
        String retVal
        Get phDispatchDriver to hDispatchDriver
        Get InvokeComMethod of hDispatchDriver 100 OLE_VT_BSTR to retVal
        Function_Return retVal
    End_Function
End_Class

